    # game/books.rpy:334
    old "It all began with a list. Your name was insignificant - another in a line of many, but with time you proved to be my greatest challenge, my deepest desire, and ultimately my downfall."
    new "It all began with a list. Your name was insignificant - another in a line of many, but with time you proved to be my greatest challenge, my deepest desire, and ultimately my downfall."

    # game/books.rpy:335
    old "At first it was nothing more than a mere curiosity, yet something about you stood out—something unique, a warmth that even I could feel. As I began to watch you my interest in you deepened, and as it did I came to know you, the real you. Every choice you made was a testament to your devotion to others. Your selflessness shone brightly, inspiring others around you. Your successes filled me with happiness. You embodied everything I was not."
    new "At first it was nothing more than a mere curiosity, yet something about you stood out—something unique, a warmth that even I could feel. As I began to watch you my interest in you deepened, and as it did I came to know you, the real you. Every choice you made was a testament to your devotion to others. Your selflessness shone brightly, inspiring others around you. Your successes filled me with happiness. You embodied everything I was not."

    # game/books.rpy:336
    old "This feeling was unlike anything I had ever known before. How did I come to feel this way, what power could a mere mortal possess to sway my heart?"
    new "This feeling was unlike anything I had ever known before. How did I come to feel this way, what power could a mere mortal possess to sway my heart?"

    # game/books.rpy:337
    old "With every passing day my senses grew overwhelmed by my adoration. I could think of nothing else, but you. You were my first thought upon awakening, and my final thought as I drifted off to sleep. I realized that I could not allow any harm to come to you."
    new "With every passing day my senses grew overwhelmed by my adoration. I could think of nothing else, but you. You were my first thought upon awakening, and my final thought as I drifted off to sleep. I realized that I could not allow any harm to come to you."

    # game/books.rpy:338
    old "And so I intervened, I broke the rules to protect you. A slight push here, a gentle breeze there —subtle influences to steer you out of harm’s way. You never knew it was me, but you seemed grateful for the intervention. A small smile would grace your lips, perhaps you thought you were lucky? Every smile you unknowingly directed my way filled me with a warmth I had never known. I yearned to reveal myself to you, to bridge the gap between us, but courage always eluded me."
    new "And so I intervened, I broke the rules to protect you. A slight push here, a gentle breeze there —subtle influences to steer you out of harm’s way. You never knew it was me, but you seemed grateful for the intervention. A small smile would grace your lips, perhaps you thought you were lucky? Every smile you unknowingly directed my way filled me with a warmth I had never known. I yearned to reveal myself to you, to bridge the gap between us, but courage always eluded me."

    # game/books.rpy:339
    old "Oftentimes, I would find you lost in thought as you gazed out at the world before you. I wondered what occupied your mind. Then one day, I succumbed to my desires. I appeared to you as a creature I knew you could not overlook —a white raven. You noticed me, and from then on, you eagerly awaited my return."
    new "Oftentimes, I would find you lost in thought as you gazed out at the world before you. I wondered what occupied your mind. Then one day, I succumbed to my desires. I appeared to you as a creature I knew you could not overlook —a white raven. You noticed me, and from then on, you eagerly awaited my return."

    # game/books.rpy:340
    old "As time passed, I began to draw closer to you, envisioning a world in which we stood together, your fingers entwined with mine. I longed for the day you might turn your head and see me. If only I were free from these otherworldly obligations, what could have existed between us?"
    new "As time passed, I began to draw closer to you, envisioning a world in which we stood together, your fingers entwined with mine. I longed for the day you might turn your head and see me. If only I were free from these otherworldly obligations, what could have existed between us?"

    # game/books.rpy:341
    old "Our daily meetings became a comforting ritual for me, and yet even like this, I struggled to be near you. I cautioned myself to keep my distance, fearing that I would let slip what I really was."
    new "Our daily meetings became a comforting ritual for me, and yet even like this, I struggled to be near you. I cautioned myself to keep my distance, fearing that I would let slip what I really was."

    # game/books.rpy:342
    old "Eventually, I withdrew."
    new "Eventually, I withdrew."

    # game/books.rpy:343
    old "I no longer intervened, and allowed life’s natural course to resume once more."
    new "I no longer intervened, and allowed life’s natural course to resume once more."

    # game/books.rpy:344
    old "When our daily ritual ceased, your confusion over my absence pained me. I agonized over the decision I had made. Over the years, you had changed me so profoundly that I no longer recognized who I was before. Truthfully, I welcomed this change, it showed me that I could not be without you. "
    new "When our daily ritual ceased, your confusion over my absence pained me. I agonized over the decision I had made. Over the years, you had changed me so profoundly that I no longer recognized who I was before. Truthfully, I welcomed this change, it showed me that I could not be without you. "

    # game/books.rpy:345
    old "Panic washed over me as I realized my mistake. Returning to your favored form, I hurried to your side once more, whispering a silent oath vowing to protect you for as long as time allowed. "
    new "Panic washed over me as I realized my mistake. Returning to your favored form, I hurried to your side once more, whispering a silent oath vowing to protect you for as long as time allowed. "

    # game/books.rpy:346
    old "But fate unfolded just as I knew, and the inevitable moment had arrived."
    new "But fate unfolded just as I knew, and the inevitable moment had arrived."

    # game/books.rpy:347
    old "I was too late, it was my fault. My hesitation. My weakness."
    new "I was too late, it was my fault. My hesitation. My weakness."

    # game/books.rpy:348
    old "A pool of crimson surrounded you."
    new "A pool of crimson surrounded you."

    # game/books.rpy:349
    old "Seeing you like this tore at my very soul. It was like nothing I had ever felt before."
    new "Seeing you like this tore at my very soul. It was like nothing I had ever felt before."

    # game/books.rpy:350
    old "As your gaze met mine, the raven fell away. I finally stood before you."
    new "As your gaze met mine, the raven fell away. I finally stood before you."

    # game/books.rpy:351
    old "'There you are,' you whispered weakly, a faint smile on your lips."
    new "'There you are,' you whispered weakly, a faint smile on your lips."

    # game/books.rpy:352
    old "Despite my sorrow, I managed a smile in return. 'My dear, I could never stay away.' The words caught in my throat, weighed down by years of silence between us. Looking at me now you did not see a white raven, you did not see your death, you saw only a man."
    new "Despite my sorrow, I managed a smile in return. 'My dear, I could never stay away.' The words caught in my throat, weighed down by years of silence between us. Looking at me now you did not see a white raven, you did not see your death, you saw only a man."

    # game/books.rpy:353
    old "I took your hand, as your final moment drew near. We were two souls destined for failure right from the start."
    new "I took your hand, as your final moment drew near. We were two souls destined for failure right from the start."

    # game/books.rpy:354
    old "I pulled you close, our first and last kiss. Your lips were cold against mine."
    new "I pulled you close, our first and last kiss. Your lips were cold against mine."

    # game/books.rpy:355
    old "Love of mine, today you have died, and with you, so shall I."
    new "Love of mine, today you have died, and with you, so shall I."

