    # game/books.rpy:457
    old "Hey there! I hope life’s been treating you kindly. If not, then I’m sorry to hear that. It happens to a lot of us, more than you know, so don’t sweat it."
    new "Hey there! I hope life’s been treating you kindly. If not, then I’m sorry to hear that. It happens to a lot of us, more than you know, so don’t sweat it."

    # game/books.rpy:458
