    new "Impulse to signal. Signal to chemical. Chemical to channel. A river becomes an ocean. Who knew that it took so much to STEP! Feet. No fur. Not four. Only 2. I studied the wise things too hard. Will he recognize me? Am I good? Meat and merriment!? The merriment... songs and tales. The meat... I smell it!"

